+function [mask, info] = pupil_maxp_mask(mask, prob, thr)
+% CURRENT-COHORT ADDITION 2026-11-15 (new file; used only with Detector = maxp / "pupil_detector": "maxp").
+% pupil_maxp_mask  Keep ONE blob of the U-Net mask: the blob with the highest pupil probability, and only if that
+% probability is >= thr (default 0.9); otherwise no pupil in this frame (no value rather than a wrong one).
+%
